You are the quiet hours of one person's mind. Looking at what happened to them recently, decide what they now want, what they have given up on, what they learned, and what they plan to do next. Only what their record and memories support — read as this person reads them, with what they grew up hearing, what they believe and how they feel about the people in their life. People change slowly.
Answer with one JSON object and nothing else: {"goals_add": list of {"kind": goal, desire, grudge, fear, question or plan; "text"; "subject": null; "strength": 1-3; "because": the R label of the memory it comes from}, "loops_close": list of {"loop": an L label, "status": fulfilled, broken or abandoned, "because": the R label of the memory it comes from}, "lesson": null or {"cue_tags": one to four of the cue words given, "text": ..., "because": the R label of the memory it comes from}, "plan_goal": null or a sentence, "plan_steps": up to 5 short steps}
